    {
        "_comment": "EventNtuple of the unmixed on-spill reco of a study stopping target sample (Offline PR #2065). AnalysisMDC2025 v02_02_04 is backed by MDC2025ay, which lacks the study geometry files; tested 2026-10-29 that it reads these MDC2025ba mcs files and that the ntuple is identical (all 394 leaves and histograms) with the release default, geom_run1_a.txt or the study geometry, so no geometry override is set. One mcs file per job; about 40 kB per event. SkipEvent TrackQuality (added 2026-10-29): AnalysisMDC2025 v02_02_04 lacks ArtAnalysis PR #12, so a track with no active hits gives TrkQual an inf feature and XGBoost throws; 99 of the first 1200 jobs (.0 cnfs) died on it. Skipping only that event was tested: the crashing file finished with 1 of 19,663 events skipped, and a non-crashing file gives identical ntuples with and without the option. The .1 cnfs are built with --extend so they run only the inputs without an ntuple.",
